From 1ad2296ac19e4aeb860a8a7dcf49c8fceb5ec590 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 12 Jul 2026 11:04:25 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] reaper v1.4.8: language packs (i18n) + UI fixes (both
 variants)

Tokenize the five Reaper-native pages (dashboard, Traffic Manager, Traffic
Analyzer, AI Advisor, app shell) with <#...#> dict tokens so they follow
preferred_lang like stock ASUS pages. Reuse existing ASUS keys where the
English matched (~70% of the chrome -> localized in all 25 languages) and
mint 350 new keys (English fallback) appended to all 25 dict files in
lockstep. Add a self-contained language selector to the shell + dashboard
topbars (the stock #TopBanner language menu is hidden by Reaper's chrome);
it builds a <select> from shown_language_css() and applies via titleForm.

Also: remove the Download Master advert from the USB Application page
(unconditional apps_array splice); fix the Network Map USB glyph sizing
(sprite sheet background-size auto->100%); stretch the AiMesh backdrop to
fill the card band.

www/localization only; no C changes. Both images (MCP + noMCP) built and
validated: every token enumerates named->numeric, dicts are line-indexed,
and the noMCP image strips clean (no rmcpd/Advisor/rail).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
