+RQOS_94=served last
+RQOS_95=Priority classes must sit ABOVE all Weighted classes (row
+RQOS_96=is Priority below a Weighted row). Reorder, or make it Weighted.
+RQOS_97=At least one class must have a non-zero upload ceiling (%).
+RQOS_98=Guaranteed minimums total
+RQOS_99=%. Guarantees cannot exceed 100% of the upload - lower the Min values (or switch off Guaranteed minimums).
+RTRF_01=Bandwidth &amp; Usage
+RTRF_02=Live
+RTRF_03=Live refresh rate
