+RTRF_56=HW QoS Classful
+RTRF_57=Per-class stats require the QoS engine. Traffic shaping is currently <b>off</b> &mdash; enable <b>HW QoS Classful</b> in Traffic Manager to populate this panel.
+RTRF_58=Per-class stats require <b>HW QoS Classful</b> (the 5-queue engine). QoS is running <b>
+RTRF_59=</b>, which has no per-class queues. Switch the engine in Traffic Manager to see this data.
